Description:
E. Braude (London) Ltd. are thermal process equipment specialists, manufacturing industrial equipment for use with corrosive and other liquids. Braude products include electric tank heaters, heat exchangers, pumps, controllers and a range of accessories all designed for harsh industrial processes. Braude products are used in applications such as:

- Metal processing - from electroplating to stainless steel pickling; 
- Chemical processing; 
- Water industry. 

Other applications include those where the inert properties of the products do not cause any contamination of the solutions, such as:

- Medical and pharmaceutical; 
- Biochemical processes; 
- Fish aquaria and farming. 

Braude products are manufactured in the UK and have been used worldwide for many years providing efficient service in arduous processes in many leading companies from aerospace to steel processing.

Braude has always maintained a commitment to produce products and service of the highest quality. Braude's quality systems are accredited by UKAS and approved to ISO 9001:2008

In December 2016 Braude became a member of the NIBE Group.

We have over 100 years experience both designing and building our own high quality products as well as helping partners with their varied manufacturing needs. 
Elements of our total solutions:
Concept consultancy; 
Feasibility and prototyping; 
Innovative electronic design; 
Creative production engineering; 
High quality, efficient PCB  assembly; 
Comprehensive manufacturing expertise; 
Flexible procurement and distribution partner

Prana is a manufacturer of mechanical ventilation systems with recuperation. Our systems work on the base of a patented copper heat exchanger which provides recuperation efficiency up to 98%.

We manufacturе decentralized and centralized systems which are suitable for:
•	offices;
•	malls;
•	beauty salons;
•	restaurants;
•	premises;
•	industrial objects.

Decentralized systems can be mounted in less than 2 hours and are controlled with remote control or mobile application. Recuperators are provided with AUTO mode as well, with the help of which the system independently reacts on the air quality, quantity of people in the room and regulates the air exchange speed.

With PRANA you will always receive quality air for the well-being of your employees or guests.

Text us to get the price list of our ventilation systems or to discuss the partnership always.

Since 1963, Kane International Ltd has been in Welwyn Garden City, Hertfordshire, and has a long history and broad experience designing and manufacturing portable test equipment.
Almost all its products are designed in-house using the latest development tools.
Products are marketed under KANE's range of brands and for numerous  ‘private label’ companies.

KANE has specific competence in:

Electrochemical sensors;
Infra-red benches;
Data logging;
Electricity monitoring;
Low power electronics;
Portable battery powered equipment.

KANE stocks a wide range of Alpha standard calibration gases and all our gas products are calibrated using ‘live’ test gases.

The KANE Service Department provides repair and Certification with traceability to National Standards.
Portable flue gas analyzers measure the efficiency and pollution of combustion gases. Improving efficiency not only makes significant financial savings but also reduces atmospheric pollution. KANE Analysers range from single gas pocket analysers to portable muti-gas data logging units for semi-continuous monitoring.

KANE has also developed the KANE Automotive range of portable exhaust gas analyzers meeting the accuracy and functionality of OIML Class 1 standard. These battery powered, truly portable handheld analysers set new standards of functionality in vehicle and fork lift truck emissions monitoring.

Finder is Europe’s leading manufacturer of relays, timers, monitoring products & level control with a worldwide sales and distribution network.  The company’s product range also includes interface modules for commercial electrical installations and a comprehensive range of solutions for industrial and residential applications.

Founded in 1954 in Italy, the company has been supplying relays to the UK market since the early 1970s. Its subsidiary, Finder plc, was established in 1993, and its operation is located at a purpose built facility in Stone, Stafffordshire.

As well as a comprehensive product range of over 14,500 products, Finder plc provides professional, rapid local support to its customer base through:

- a fully equipped applications and analysis laboratory with dedicated technical division to support customers in the application of electromechanical and electronic timing components;

- a team of on-the-ground area sales managers and in-house sales team;

- a fully stocked warehouse and logistics team to ensure excellent supply through its distributor network in the UK and Republic of Ireland.

McDowell Electrical Services Ltd is a leading Electrical Services provider, based in Northern Ireland, servicing Commercial & Domestic clients across the UK & Ireland.

We are trusted Electrical experts, specialising in providing first class quality of work within;

Commercial (high end Retail chains, Fast Food outlets, Children's activity Centres and Bars & Restaurants);
Domestic (Local Developments, Private & Social Apartments).

We have a team of qualified, vast experienced Electricians who carry a proven track record of delivering a gold standard of work to small and large clients across the UK & Ireland.

If you would like to talk to us about our services reach out to us at info@mcdelectserv.co.uk

Elite Energy are specialist suppliers and installers of energy efficient retrofit and new lighting solutions throughout the UK and Ireland.

Elite Energy provides guidance and support to help you save money and CO2.

Our experts can help you at every stage to meet your objectives. We provide FREE:

    Site surveys;
    Payback/ROI calculations;
    Financial justifications;
    CO2 calculations;
    Measurement;
    Funding Options.

Our turnkey solution reduces time and effort by combining product supply, installation and project management in a single highly-competitive package. Elite Energy has successfully completed projects for a variety of businesses, institutions and government agencies across virtually all facility types under an array of conditions.
